IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLTOBL.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "BLNSTO".
COPY "BCRSTO".
01 WS-HOME PIC X(80).
01 BK-LN-REC.
   COPY "BLN".
01 BK-CR-FAC.
   COPY "BCRF".

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "CLTP".

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-CLT-PARMS.
    MOVE "00" TO CP-RC
    ACCEPT WS-HOME FROM ENVIRONMENT "BANK_HOME"
    EVALUATE FUNCTION TRIM(CP-OBL-TYPE)
        WHEN "LOAN" PERFORM LOAD-LOAN
        WHEN "FACIL" PERFORM LOAD-FACILITY
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE "20" TO CP-RC
            MOVE "UNKNOWN OBLIGATION TYPE" TO CP-MSG
    END-EVALUATE
    GOBACK.

LOAD-LOAN.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-LN-REC
    MOVE CP-OBL-ID TO LN-ID
    MOVE "GET" TO NS-OP
    CALL "BLNSTO" USING BK-LN-STO-REQ BK-LN-REC
    IF NS-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "23" TO CP-RC
        MOVE "LOAN NOT FOUND" TO CP-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF LN-STATUS = "CLO" OR LN-STATUS = "CAN"
        OR LN-STATUS = "SET"
        MOVE "20" TO CP-RC
        MOVE "OBLIGATION CLOSED" TO CP-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE LN-CUST-ID TO CP-CUST-ID
    MOVE LN-FAC-ID TO CP-FAC-ID
    MOVE LN-CURRENCY TO CP-CURRENCY.

LOAD-FACILITY.
    MOVE SPACES TO BK-CR-FAC
    MOVE CP-OBL-ID TO CRF-ID
    MOVE "GET" TO CS-OP
    CALL "BCRFSTO" USING BK-CR-STO-REQ BK-CR-FAC
    IF CS-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "23" TO CP-RC
        MOVE "FACILITY NOT FOUND" TO CP-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    IF CRF-STATUS = "CLS" OR CRF-STATUS = "CAN"
        OR CRF-STATUS = "EXP"
        MOVE "20" TO CP-RC
        MOVE "OBLIGATION CLOSED" TO CP-MSG
        EXIT PARAGRAPH
    END-IF
    MOVE CRF-CUST-ID TO CP-CUST-ID
    MOVE CRF-ID TO CP-FAC-ID
    MOVE CRF-CURRENCY TO CP-CURRENCY.
